lquier edad, a nuevos y viejos competidores, sin importar los tiempos de resoluci\u00f3n.\r\n* Por razones sanitarias, no estar\u00e1n permitidos los acompa\u00f1antes a menos que sea necesario y est\u00e9 justificado debidamente (p.ej. menores de edad). M\u00e1ximo un acompa\u00f1ante por persona.\r\n* La competencia funcionar\u00e1 de acuerdo a la [Pol\u00edtica de Seguridad de la WCA](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/documents\/policies\/external\/Competition%20Safety.pdf), por lo tanto es importante que la lean para evitar inconvenientes, adem\u00e1s, se debe tener en cuenta que el Delegado de la WCA puede descalificar a cualquier competidor cuyo comportamiento constituya un riesgo para la salud de los dem\u00e1s. No se realizan reembolsos por descalificaci\u00f3n, seg\u00fan la regla [2l1](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2l1) del Reglamento de la WCA.\r\n* Los competidores deben llevar sus propios puzzles.\r\n* Los competidores tienen que estar presentes y listos para competir cuando se los llama, de no ser as\u00ed se penalizar\u00e1 al competidor con la descalificaci\u00f3n del evento (de la categor\u00eda, no de toda la competencia), de acuerdo con el art\u00edculo [2u](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2u) del reglamento.\r\n* Leer toda la informaci\u00f3n disponible en esta p\u00e1gina.\r\n\r\n**\u00a1Importante!**\r\n\r\n**La competencia puede ser cancelada por la Junta Directiva de la WCA si la situaci\u00f3n de la pandemia empeora.**\r\n\r\nAnte cualquier duda consultar al organizador o el Delegado de la WCA. \r\n\r\n**English:**\r\nYOU MUST NOT SHOW UP AT THE COMPETITION WITH SYMPTOMS OF THE COVID-19.\r\nCompetitor limit: 30.\r\n\r\n* Read the [WCA Regulations](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/) to avoid any issue.\r\n* This competition is open to competitors of any nationality or age.\r\n* For safety reasons, guests won't be allowed inside the venue, unless a competitor requires a guest for any justified reason (e.g. minors). Only one guest per competitor allowed.\r\n* This competition will be held in accordance with the [WCA Safety Policy](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/documents\/policies\/external\/Competition%20Safety.pdf). Please, remember that the WCA Delegate may disqualify any competitor that behaves in a way that is unsafe for other people's health inside the venue (see regulation [2k3](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2k3)). A disqualified competitor is not eligible for the refund of any expenses due to participating in the competition (regulation [2l1](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2l1)). Please read the WCA Safety Policy to avoid any issue.\r\n* Competitors must provide their own puzzles.\r\n* Competitors must be present and ready to compete when called, otherwise the competitor will be penalized with the disqualification of the event, in accordance with the article [2u](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/regulations\/#2u) of the WCA Regulations.\r\n* Read all the information available in this website.\r\n\r\n**Attention!**\r\n\r\n**The competition may be canceled by the WCA Board if the pandemic situation gets worse.**\r\n\r\nFor any question, feel free to contact the organizer or the WCA Delegate.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"AltavistaNxN2023","name":"Altavista NxN 2023","city":"Montevideo","country":"UY","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333","444","444bf","555","555bf","666","777"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Gennaro Monetti}{mailto:gmonetti@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Manuel Malv\u00e1rez}{mailto:manumalvarez770@gmail.com}]","organiser":"[{Asociaci\u00f3n Uruguaya de Speedcubing}{mailto:aus-competitions@googlegroups.com}] [{Sebastiano Benato}{mailto:sebastianomre@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"[Grupo Altavista Lab & Trend](https:\/\/www.grupoaltavista.com.uy\/)","address":"Av. Uruguay 1529, 11200 Montevideo, Departa