er sonstigen F\u00e4higkeiten. Manche Events haben ein spezifisches Zeitlimit, damit wir sicherstellen k\u00f6nnen den ganzen Tag \u00fcber im Zeitplan zu bleiben. Es d\u00fcrfen Puzzles jeder Marke verwendet werden solange sie den WCA Richtlinien entsprechen. \r\n\r\nDa dies ein sehr kleines, ruhiges und auch kurzes Turnier wird sind generell keine G\u00e4ste erlaubt (da wir auch von der R\u00e4umlichkeit begrenzt sind) - falls jedoch ein Teilnehmer einen Gast dabei haben muss, zb. weil du Minderj\u00e4hrig bist und deinen Erziehungsberechtigten dabei haben willst, dann schreibt uns bitte noch vor dem Turnier eine E-mail mit einer Begr\u00fcndung und mit dem Namen des Gastes.\r\n\r\nGenerell herrscht absolute Ruhe w\u00e4hrend des Gesamten Turnieres (ausgenommen von den Pausen) da es sich um Blind Events sowohl als auch um Fewest Moves handelt.\r\n\r\nWir freuen uns besonders auf neue Speedcuber aus \u00d6sterreich!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n#### **English:**\r\n\r\nWe are happy to announce the BF Vienna 2023 as an official WCA Competition. \r\n\r\nThe speedcubing competition is organised by Florian Truckenthanner and Simon Praschl and delegated by \u0160imon Borovsk\u00fd and Viktor Kalmar. The results of the competition will be added to the official WCA World Rankings.\r\n\r\nThe competition is open to all competitors regardless of experience and skill, but certain event-based time limits will be in place to make sure we can stay on schedule and get through the day on time. No prior experience in WCA competitions is necessary, but competitors must be familiar with the WCA Regulations. Any puzzle brand may be used during the competition, as long as it complies with the WCA regulations.\r\n\r\nThis competition is going to be quite small, short and especially quiet and because of this no guests will be allowed at this competition (also because it is a small room).\r\nIf you have a good reason why a guest should accompany you (e.g.: you are a minor and you want to have your legal guardian with you), then please let us know before the competition via email (include the name of the guest and the reasoning).\r\n\r\nIt has to be absolutely quiet during the whole competition (except during the breaks) because we have Blind and Fewest Moves events only.\r\n","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"BhanuBhaktaCubeOpen2020","name":"BhanuBhakta Cube Open 2020","city":"Kathmandu","country":"NP","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333fm","333oh","444","555","666","777","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Akula Pavan Kumar}{mailto:pavanakula21@gmail.com}]","organiser":"[{Anup Adhikari}{mailto:christ.anup103@gmail.com}] [{Bishal Shrestha}{mailto:s.bishal97@gmail.com}] [{Kritika KC}{mailto:kritikakc77@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"[Bhanu Bhakta Memorial H.S School](http:\/\/www.bhanu.edu.np\/) ","address":"\u092d\u093e\u0928\u0941\u092d\u0915\u094d\u200d\u0924\u094d\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u092e\u094b\u0930\u0940\u092f\u0932 \u0938\u0921\u0915, Kathmandu 44600","details":"4th Floor, School Hall","coordinates":{"latitude":27.726764,"longitude":85.324708}},"information":"","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"BhejaFryYearEndOpen2017","name":"Bheja Fry Year End Open 2017","city":"Bengaluru, Karnataka","country":"IN","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","333fm","333mbf","444bf","555bf"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Daniel James}{mailto:djames@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Speed Cubing Bangalore}{mailto:speedcubingbangalore@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"Skill Centre of Excellence","address":"Skill Centre of Excellence, #300, 6th main, Arekere MICO Layout Stage 1, Bengaluru - 560076","details":"","coordinates":{"latitude":12.889658,"longitude":77.594562}},"information":"Online registration ends on 28th December, 2017. On the spot registration is available. Visit [registration & payment tab](https:\/\/www.worldcubeas